sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Sender's screen
    participant R as Receiver's camera

    loop ~10 frames a second, ~600 bytes each
        S-->>R: one LT-coded block
    end
    Note over S,R: the manifest is woven in every 20 frames, so a receiver can join mid-stream
    Note over S,R: no back channel. none. the sender cannot tell how the receiver is doing except by looking at it.
